  "translation": "Na David i tok: Mi bai mekim khesed wantaim Hanun, pikinini bilong Nakas, long wanem, papa bilong en i mekim khesed wantaim mi. Na David i salim ol mesinja bilong strongim em long papa bilong en. Na ol wokman bilong David i kam insait long graun bilong ol pikinini Amon, go long Hanun, bilong strongim em.",
